  TutorialStepIndex: 2
  DialogueList:
  - "The rules are delightfully simple: shape your hand as close to twenty\u2011one
    as you can\u2014no larger, or you\u2019ll burst like a soap bubble."
  - "Remember: if you lose the round, you take damage equal to your own gap from
    the limit\u2014draw 14 against 21 and you\u2019ll eat 7 points; bust to 30 and
    you\u2019ll swallow 9."
  - Click the glowing Hit button to pluck a new card from the deck.
